# Extended Error Help: {{ .errorCode }}

## What happened?
This CEL predicate did not return a boolean value:

```text
{{ .code }}
```

## Why Hydra stops here
Filter flags like `--include`, `--exclude`, and `--predicate` must evaluate to `true` or `false` for each entity.
The expression above returned some other value instead.

## Resolution
Convert the expression into an explicit boolean check.

Example:

```bash
hydra local find cluster.app --include 'templateEntity.spec.template.spec.containers != null'
```

Instead of:

```bash
hydra local find cluster.app --include 'templateEntity.spec.template.spec.containers'
```

## Next step
Make the predicate return an explicit `true` or `false` value for every entity.
